WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 85b5a694c9e806f0735e3ee2c8b94eab

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.080
Karibu tena. Sawa, hadi sasa tumeangalia

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.580
vitendakazi vinavyofanya jambo fulani huko nje. Kwa mfano,

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.800
kitendakazi circle (duara) huchora duara. Kitendakazi

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.640
move (sogea) husogeza mhusika wako. Lakini vitendakazi vingine

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.960
hufanya kazi kwa namna tofauti. Badala ya kufanya kitu cha nje,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.430
vinakupa kitu ambacho unaweza kutumia

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:24.700
kwenye msimbo wako. Kitendakazi kinapompa Jiki kitu

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.840
cha kutumia kwenye msimbo,

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.640
tunasema kuwa kitendakazi hicho kinarejesha (returning kwa Kiingereza) kitu.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:34.310
Kinarejesha kitu kurudi kwa Jiki. Unaweza

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.720
kufikiria mashine hizi kuwa na

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.340
mteremko wa matokeo. Tayari tuna matundu ya ingizo

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.620
ambayo tunaweka vitu ndani, lakini tunaweza pia

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.860
kuwa na tundu moja la matokeo au mteremko

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.560
ambao kitu kinaweza kutokea.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.840
Jiki anapobonyeza kitufe kwenye mashine,

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.600
mashine inanguruma, na mwishowe kitu kitatokea

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.060
kwenye mteremko huo. Inaweza

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.760
kuwa namba. Inaweza kuwa string.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:59.600
Ni kitu ambacho Jiki anaweza kunasa na

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:05.540
kutumia. Vitendakazi vingi, huenda asilimia 95 kati yao,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.740
vinarejesha kitu. Vinaweza kukufanyia hesabu fulani

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.460
na kurejesha thamani, au vinaweza kuunganisha

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.980
string kadhaa pamoja na kukupa

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.900
string inayotokana na hiyo. Au huenda vinakupa

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:19.140
muda wa sasa kila unapoendesha

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.690
mashine hiyo. Hebu tuangalie hili la mwisho.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.880
Tuseme tuna kitendakazi kinachoitwa

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.690
getCurrentTime (pata muda wa sasa). Kila Jiki anapoendesha mashine,

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.920
kipande cha karatasi kinatoka kwenye mteremko

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.400
wa matokeo kikiwa na muda umeandikwa juu yake, labda

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:36.300
14:35. Na kisha tunaweza kuweka thamani hiyo

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:39.740
iliyorejeshwa kwenye sanduku kwa kutumia let. Tukisema

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:43.980
let time = getCurrentTime(), Jiki

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.820
ataendesha mashine, atapata muda wa sasa

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.940
kutoka kwenye mteremko, na kuuhifadhi kwenye

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:53.640
sanduku linaloitwa time. Sasa, ni muhimu kuelewa

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.080
kuwa kipande cha karatasi ambacho Jiki anaweka

00:01:56.180 --> 00:01:59.680
kwenye sanduku ni kitu kilichowekwa wakati huo na hakibadiliki.

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.940
Hata kama muda halisi unabadilika wakati

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:04.500
programu yako inaendelea kufanya kazi, sanduku bado lina

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:08.380
kipande hicho cha karatasi kilichoandikwa 14:35.

00:02:08.449 --> 00:02:10.920
Kitu kikiwa kimeshaingia kwenye sanduku,

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.140
kinabaki kama kilivyo humo. Hakibadiliki kwa miujiza.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.980
Tukitaka kuweka muda wa sasa

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.420
kwenye sanduku tena siku zijazo, tunahitaji

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.860
kutumia kitendakazi chetu cha getCurrentTime tena

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:27.100
ili kuupata. Vitendakazi vingi vinavyorejesha vitu

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.950
pia vina maingizo. Kwa mfano, tunaweza kuwa na

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:33.430
kitendakazi join (unganisha) kinachopokea string mbili

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.350
kama maingizo yake na kuzirejesha zimeunganishwa pamoja

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.600
kwa nafasi moja. Kwa hivyo tukitumia mashine ya join

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:43.920
tukiwa na "Hello" na "World" kama maingizo yetu,

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.160
string moja itatoka kwenye mteremko

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:50.710
iliyoandikwa "Hello World". Katika

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:55.100
mazoezi yanayofuata, utatumia vitendakazi vinavyorejesha vitu.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.200
Utahitaji kuhifadhi thamani

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:59.400
ambazo vinarejesha na kuzitumia mahali sahihi

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:02.300
kwenye msimbo wako. Maelekezo yatakuambia

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.780
kila kitu unachohitaji kujua, kwa hivyo usijali.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.540
Kila la heri, na tutaonana

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:07.200
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
